@startuml EnemyStateMachine

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

<style>
stateDiagram {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor #555555
  FontSize 11
}
state {
  BackgroundColor #f0f4ff
  BorderColor #555555
  FontSize 11
}
arrow {
  LineColor #333333
  FontSize 10
}
note {
  BackgroundColor #fff8e1
  BorderColor #ccaa00
  FontSize 10
}
</style>

[*] --> Spawning : Instantiated

state "Spawning"    as Spawning
state "Chasing"     as Chasing
state "Knocked Back" as KnockedBack
state "Dead"        as Dead

Spawning    --> Chasing      : spawnStunTimer expires\n(scale 0 → 1 complete)

Chasing     --> KnockedBack  : player weapon hit\n[ApplyKnockback()]
Chasing     --> KnockedBack  : contact with player\n[self-bounce after dealing damage]
Chasing     --> Dead         : health ≤ 0

KnockedBack --> Chasing      : knockbackTimer expires
KnockedBack --> Dead         : health ≤ 0

Dead        --> [*]          : score awarded, item drop\nattempted, GameObject destroyed

note right of Spawning
  Enemy scales from 0 to 1 over
  spawnStunDuration (default 0.6 s).
  No movement or rotation during this phase.
end note

note right of Chasing
  Each FixedUpdate: rotate toward player
  (Atan2), then move at moveSpeed.
  OnTriggerStay2D: deals damage to player
  on contact (damageCooldown gated).
end note

note right of KnockedBack
  An impulse force is applied; rb.velocity
  is NOT overwritten each frame while
  knockbackTimer > 0.
  A 0.05 s red flash plays concurrently
  whenever TakeDamage() is called.
end note

@enduml
